invariant: INV-16
file: x25519_wide_edwards.h
catches: diff_x25519_wide
reason: to_u writes (Z - Y) / (Z + Y), the u of the negated y, which is
  1 / u: another point than the ladder's. bin/diff_x25519_wide holds to_u
  to spec/lean/Spec/X25519Edwards.lean's toU, which is what makes the Lean
  proof that the key generation writes the u of s B a proof about this
